  {
   "id": "d3_legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1220,
   "y": 660,
   "width": 639.1000000000001,
   "height": 52.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 300129,
   "updated": 1,
   "boundElements": null,
   "text": "Query engine (query.py) \u00b7 Search (Zoekt) \u00b7 Semantic (LanceDB) \u00b7 Graph (registry.db)\ntypeHierarchy returns an explicit error, never empty arrays \u2014 the converter never\npopulates global_symbols.relationships, so \"no supertypes\" would be a false claim.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
